      "description": "Join millions of students worldwide who use UNiDAYS to enjoy unbeatable student and graduate deals on hundreds of top brands, both online and in-store, every day—all for FREE. From discounts, promo codes and coupons to giveaways, free stuff and easy side hustles, boost your budget and live student life to the max!\n\nSTUDENT DISCOUNTS ARE JUST A TAP AWAY \nAll you need is your school, college or uni email address to start saving every time you shop with a UNiDAYS promo code—it’s that easy! Save up to 50% on hundreds of brands, from fashion and food to tech and travel:  \n- Fashion, shoes and accessories from brands like ASOS, Boohoo, Shein, Ray-Ban, Farfetch, Calvin Klein, Ugg, Levi’s, Missguided, Urban Outfitters, Schuh, New Look, North Face and more\n- Tech for lectures and your study breaks from Apple, Samsung, Microsoft, Curry’s, Voxi, Three and HP \n- Trending beauty and skincare heroes from Charlotte Tilbury, LOOKFANTASTIC, Sephora, Cult Beauty, MAC and Morphe \n- Food and drink brands for home cooking or a cheeky takeaway like Black Sheep Coffee, Uber Eats, Hello Fresh, Deliveroo, Domino’s, Burger King and more \n- Travel to see friends and family or take the ultimate holiday with brands like Hotels.com, Emirates, FlixBus and Airbnb, National Express and Expedia\n- Lifestyle brands for days out and days in, like Amazon, Disney+, NowTV, Duolingo, GoPro, Virgin Experience Days and Thorpe Park\n- Sports brands like Under Armour, adidas, Nike, New Balance, Foot Locker, PureGym and JD Sports \n- For mental health, wellness and study support, there are tools from brands like BetterHelp, Miindset, Grammarly, Study Together, Skillshare, StudySmarter and Handshake\n\nREADY TO START SAVING MONEY AND MORE?\nAlongside unbeatable student discounts, UNiDAYS has a wide range of tools to help boost your learning, earning and personal development. Get better grades while keeping a happy and healthy mind through the ups and downs of student and graduate life—you can even take creative courses and access academic libraries! Learn data science, languages, grammar and more from expert study and revision tools, too.\n\nDownload UNiDAYS for FREE now and get instant access to student offers, uni deals, giveaways, coupons, freebies and opportunities every day.\n\nwww.myunidays.com\nInstagram/Twitter: @MyUNiDAYS\nwww.facebook.com/unidays",
